// Issue #65 fixture — pilot roster panel end-to-end.
//
// Player aboard VB city with:
//   - ¥1,000,000 cash (covers two pilot signing fees with head-room;
//     MS purchases route through the debug broker handle which doesn't
//     debit, same as the ms-roster smoke)
//   - A lightFreighter flagship docked at vonBraun (gives the VB surface
//     hangar a home POI to deliver MS into)
//   - Two pilot-hireable NPCs at VB with distinct piloting skill, so the
//     roster's best-first ordering is deterministic
//
// The smoke seeds the two MS through the broker debug path (buy civFighter
// + mobileWorker → tick → receive); MS aren't fixture-seedable. The order
// of hire-vs-receive leaves exactly one MS unpiloted for the reassign step.
